#: src/Ui/EmailShortcode.php:36
msgid "Please log in to write emails."
msgstr "Bitte logge dich ein, um E-Mails zu schreiben."

#: src/Ui/EmailShortcode.php:40
msgid "Write email"
msgstr "E-Mail schreiben"

#: src/Ui/EmailShortcode.php:41
msgid "Sent emails"
msgstr "Gesendete E-Mails"

#: src/Ui/EmailShortcode.php:44
msgid "Automatic emails"
msgstr "Automatische E-Mails"

#: src/Ui/EmailShortcode.php:47
msgid "You are not allowed to send emails."
msgstr "Du darfst keine E-Mails senden."

#. translators: %s: maximum size, e.g. "10 MB"
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:68
#, php-format
msgid "The attachments are too large. At most %s can be uploaded at once."
msgstr ""
"Die Anhänge sind zu groß. Es können höchstens %s auf einmal hochgeladen "
"werden."

#. translators: %d: number of recipients
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:115
#, php-format
msgid "Your email has been sent to %d recipients."
msgstr "Deine E-Mail wurde an %d Empfänger gesendet."

#. translators: %d: number of recipients
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:117
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your email is being sent to %d recipients. Large groups take a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Deine E-Mail wird an %d Empfänger gesendet. Bei großen Gruppen dauert das "
"einige Minuten."

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:127
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Gesendet"

#. translators: 1: number of sent emails, 2: number of recipients
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:130
#, php-format
msgid "Sending (%1$d of %2$d)"
msgstr "Wird gesendet (%1$d von %2$d)"

#. translators: %d: number of emails that could not be sent
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:136
#, php-format
msgid "%d failed"
msgstr "%d fehlgeschlagen"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:150
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Datum"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:151
msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Absender"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:153 src/Ui/EmailView.php:368
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Gruppen"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:154 src/Ui/EmailView.php:179 src/Ui/EmailView.php:370
msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Empfänger"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:155
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:158
msgid "No emails have been sent yet."
msgstr "Es wurden noch keine E-Mails gesendet."

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:161
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Texts are deleted once sent. The log shows who emailed which groups for %d "
"days."
msgstr ""
"Die Texte werden nach dem Versand gelöscht. Das Protokoll zeigt %d Tage "
"lang, wer welchen Gruppen geschrieben hat."

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:215
msgid "Select the recipients, then choose how to write to them."
msgstr "Wähle die Empfänger aus und dann, wie du ihnen schreiben möchtest."

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:228
msgid "Write in my email app"
msgstr "In meinem E-Mail-Programm schreiben"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:229 src/Ui/EmailView.php:314
msgid "Copy addresses"
msgstr "Adressen kopieren"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:230
msgid "Write and send here"
msgstr "Hier schreiben und senden"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:233
msgid "How do you want to write?"
msgstr "Wie möchtest du schreiben?"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:248 src/Ui/EmailView.php:381
msgid "Replies go to"
msgstr "Antworten an"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:252
msgid ""
"Prefilled with your email address. Recipients' replies go to this address."
msgstr ""
"Vorausgefüllt mit deiner E-Mail-Adresse. Antworten der Empfänger gehen an "
"diese Adresse."

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:264
msgid "Every recipient gets their own email."
msgstr "Alle Empfänger bekommen eine eigene E-Mail."

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:269
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Prüfen"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:285
#, php-format
msgid ""
"With %1$d characters, the link is longer than some email apps accept (about "
"%2$d, e.g. Outlook on Windows). They may leave out recipients or not open at "
"all. Copying the addresses is the safer option."
msgstr ""
"Mit %1$d Zeichen ist der Link länger, als manche E-Mail-Programme annehmen "
"(etwa %2$d, z. B. Outlook unter Windows). Sie lassen dann Empfänger weg oder "
"öffnen sich gar nicht. Sicherer ist es, die Adressen zu kopieren."

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:296
msgid "Open my email app"
msgstr "Mein E-Mail-Programm öffnen"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:309
msgid "Email addresses"
msgstr "E-Mail-Adressen"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:314
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Kopiert"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:323
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d address. Put it in BCC, so that recipients do not see each other's "
"addresses."
msgid_plural ""
"%d addresses. Put them in BCC, so that recipients do not see each other's "
"addresses."
msgstr[0] ""
"%d Adresse. Setze sie ins BCC, damit die Empfänger die Adressen der anderen "
"nicht sehen."
msgstr[1] ""
"%d Adressen. Setze sie ins BCC, damit die Empfänger die Adressen der anderen "
"nicht sehen."

#. translators: %d: number of recipients
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:372
#, php-format
msgid "%d person"
msgid_plural "%d people"
msgstr[0] "%d Person"
msgstr[1] "%d Personen"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:376
msgid ""
"You get a copy that names you as the sender and lists the groups. The others "
"do not see the groups."
msgstr ""
"Du bekommst eine Kopie, die dich als Absender nennt und die Gruppen "
"auflistet. Die anderen sehen die Gruppen nicht."

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:386 src/Ui/EmailView.php:426
msgid "Attachments"
msgstr "Anhänge"

#. translators: %d: number of recipients
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:403
#, php-format
msgid "Send the email to %d person now?"
msgid_plural "Send the email to %d people now?"
msgstr[0] "Die E-Mail jetzt an %d Person senden?"
msgstr[1] "Die E-Mail jetzt an %d Personen senden?"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:411
msgid "Send"
msgstr "Senden"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:417
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Bearbeiten"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:441
msgid "Add attachments"
msgstr "Anhänge hinzufügen"

#. translators: 1: maximum number of files, 2: maximum size, e.g. "10 MB"
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Up to %1$d files with %2$s in total, e.g. PDF, images or Office documents."
msgstr ""
"Bis zu %1$d Dateien mit insgesamt %2$s, z. B. PDF, Bilder oder Office-"
"Dokumente."

#. translators: date format, see https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php; German: j. F Y
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:474
msgid "F j, Y"
msgstr "j. F Y"

#. translators: time format, see https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php; German: H:i
#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:476
msgid "g:i a"
msgstr "H:i"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:521
msgid "Preview of the email"
msgstr "Vorschau der E-Mail"

#: src/Ui/EmailView.php:526
msgid ""
"This is how the recipients see the email. Your own copy also names you and "
"the groups."
msgstr ""
"So sehen die Empfänger die E-Mail. Deine eigene Kopie nennt zusätzlich dich "
"und die Gruppen."

